sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    box rgb(238,238,238) Consumer - Contabo
    participant R as Consumer application
    participant RX as Receiver
    participant CC as Consumer CP
    participant CD as Consumer DP
    end
    box rgb(226,240,255) cPouta - cloud
    participant PC as Provider CP
    participant PD as Provider DP
    end
    box rgb(240,234,250) TAU VM 2 - data source
    participant S as Data source
    end

    Note over R,S: Cloud: provider CP and DP on cPouta
    Note over R,S: Network RTT: consumer to provider CP 46 ms | provider CP to DP same host | provider DP to source 8 ms | provider DP to consumer 46 ms
    Note over R,S: Push, stock EDC 0.14.1, EDC wait 50 ms, 4 CPU / 4 GB per connector
    Note over R,RX: Consumer data platform, simulated
    Note over CD: Not used in a push

    rect rgb(220,235,255)
    Note over R,S: TC1: control signal, 272 B (source /tc1/control-signal)
    R->>CC: Catalog request
    CC->>PC: Catalog request (DSP)
    PC-->>CC: Catalog with offers
    CC-->>R: Catalog with offers
    Note over R,PC: 1) Catalog: 1,116 ms
    R->>CC: Start negotiation
    CC->>PC: Contract request
    PC-->>CC: Contract agreement
    CC->>PC: Verify agreement
    PC-->>CC: Agreement finalized
    loop negotiationPoll
        R->>CC: Poll state, every 0.1 s
    end
    Note over R,PC: 2) Negotiation, once: 2,860 ms
    loop 20 transfers
        R->>CC: Start push transfer, destination = receiver
        CC->>PC: Transfer request
        Note over CC,PC: a) request to provider CP: 123 ms
        PC->>PD: Start data flow
        PC-->>CC: Transfer start
        Note over PC,PD: b) provider CP to DP: 50 ms
        PD->>S: GET payload
        Note over PD,S: c) DP to source: 45 ms
        S-->>PD: Payload
        PD->>RX: POST payload
        Note over RX,S: d) source to receiver: 79 ms
    end
    Note over R,S: 3) One transfer, request to received: 293 ms median (242 ms to 634 ms)
    Note over R,S: TC1 to first data: 4,610 ms, then one transfer per piece of data
    end

